<title>NEW ZEALAND: JP Morgan Australia has 5.06 pct of Fletcher Paper.</title>
<headline>JP Morgan Australia has 5.06 pct of Fletcher Paper.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan Investment Management Australia declared to the New Zealand Stock Exchange on Thursday that on November 7 it became a substantial security holder in Fletcher Challenge Limited Paper Division with a relevant interest of 5.06 percent of its voting securities.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
